      "text": "Given a $4/$8 turn decision, board Kh 8h 7c 2d, hero Ah5h, one opponent with range {KsQd} betting $8 into a pot of $28 including that bet, When advice is requested, Then equity is 20.5% (9 outs of 44), required equity is 22.2% (8/36), implied required equity is 18.2% (8/44), and advice recommends call with the implied-odds rule id listing the 9 heart outs [REQ-033.3, REQ-033.7]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
